Select your program.
Anyway, you can call me Horo, where are you headed? Jeggar, I suppose?
Actually at the DTA base, but we're indeed passing through Jeggar, as we really need supplies.
I suppose.
We're ex soldiers. That idiot wants to destroy every civilization he can, including yours. We're trying to defeat him.
You mean Desert? He’s sent several threatening messages to the inhabitants of this planet before, but I never thought he was serious... or that he’d go this far... So my future depends on you, kids?
Yes, more or less! And we got pretty close, you know! We defeated him twice, but somehow he always managed to get away.
Impressive. They say he's invincible.
Listen, I don't know if you guys are talking nonsense or if you know something we don't. But if you're really going to fight him, I suggest you participate in the ''Three Challenges'' of the Arena47.
The prize is a famous sword called ''Touriel'', plus a couple of credits, which never hurt anyone. I don't know if you've ever attended it, but the challenges are all about logic, agility, and reflexes, and there's usually a final fight. If you're ex-DTA soldiers, those challenges should be a piece of cake for you.
They say that sword is indestructible, extremely light, yet also extremely deadly. Every swordsman has one on their wish list.
Let’s participate, all four of us. We’d have a better chance of winning...
Thank you for the ride.
You’re welcome. I need to warn you about the challenges, though... someone occasionally bites the dust.
Umh... Fufu... do we ALL need to partecipate?
YES, YUKI.
I have a family. I don’t want to think about seeing them die at any moment. So please, do your thing. That Desert looks like a madman...
Don't worry about your family. We will defeat him. We will absolutely destroy him. No matter what it costs.
I will win that sword. I will kill Desert, with my own hands...
Damn...
Then good luck... We count on you.
Oh, and... before I go: that water surface is completely solid, you can't cross it unless you press a button. That's to keep wild animals away from the city, you know.
Just try it.
Thank you.
So this is the city of Jeggar, huh?
Looks pretty nice...
Let's try to press the button and then cross the surface.
Wow... it IS very nice!
Remember: this is not a vacation. We need to sign up to the three challenges of whatever thing before it's too late.
Sign up for the ''Three Challenges'' at the Arena
Yeah, yeah. Bla bla bla.
Hey, sweetheart. Thank you for saving me. If it weren't for you, that idiot would've killed me.
Desert will be the next.


Yes. We need to sign up for the Three Challenges.
You're lucky. The event was about to begin.
Umh... okay. I need... your names, and I have to do a little neurological scan, it's just to allow the presenter to give a small presentation of the competitors. Don't worry, it's very quick and minimally invasive.
What?! Are you kidding me?!
Hey... I'm sure we have nothing to worry about. Sir, is it really necessary?
I'm afraid yes... Please, let's proceed immediately, registrations are about to close.
Alright. But the whole thing sounds a bit fishy to me.
Once we're done take the seats number 73, 74, 75 and 76.
Here we areee! Finally the last competitors have joined the competition!
Please, take your seats, the challenges are about to begin!
Soooo.... everyone welcome....
Fuuuuushiiikoooooo! They say she has an IQ of 25! But it is speculated that she might have as much as 36!
What?! How dare he?!!!
Quite predictable.
Theeeen we have another girl, people!
Everyone welcomee... Lucy! The most outgoing and chatty girl you could ever hope to meet!
That's not... oh no... everyone is looking at me now...
But we're not done yet! No no no, because we now have two male contenders!
I present youuu... the most mentally stable person of the whole Metra! He would never harm one single hair of any of you!
Ladies and gentlemen... Sensooo!
Well, he wasn’t that mocking toward him.
Maybe he has a problem with women...?
Finally... La crème de la crème. The man of the many resources.
You could never hope to meet a person sharper and more intelligent than him. I present you the brains of the team.
Yuuuukiii!!!
Well, he got it totally right with me!
Oh no! Someone didn't take it too well!
And did you notice their clothes? They're not "Ransteg", they're DTA Soldiers! So don’t mess with them, or you might end up turned inside out!
Great, so now we know all our contenders! I hope you're ready psychologically because there's not turning back!
The Three Challenges are about to begin! Good luck everyone!
So...
Senso, Lucy... are you two married?
Do you have children looking at you and your amazing performances?
Oh! No, n-no no no! We're just...
I mean... yes, we're just t-together, b-but we're not... m-married yet!
Ooooooh! I see! You know, if someone proposed in front of a audience like this it would be spectacular... wouldn't it?
Don't count on it.
Ahaha! Right! I don't want to get Lucy's hopes up! But if that were the case, it would be quite the proposal, ehehe...
And how about you, Heishi? Anyone you'd like to greet before our wonderful audience and all the viewers watching from home?
No, but thanks for the offer. Defeating this idiot in front of such a big audience is enough for me as it is.
Oooooh! You look pretty confident, don't you?
Yeah. He's just a traitor. He still has to learn who's in charge... and that he doesn't get to say no to daddy.
I see. So, is he your brother?
Luckily, no. He's just an arrogant little lapdog and a coward. I can't wait to start this duel... I'm done with his stupid voice.
Ah! I can't wait too! Howard, how far are we?
Almost there, sir! We're almost there!
Ahh! Great! I'm so hyped up!!
Aaaand we're back! Sorry you had to go so long without admiring us, but we'll make it worth your while!
Everyone welcoooomee.... Heishi and Senso!! Our two finalists!!
The rules are very simple... the first opponent to fall to the ground and be unable to get back up or move loses the duel!
You can do anything within your power to make that happen, as long as you don't harm the spectators! Other than that... there are no rules!
Oh and... <i>try</i> not to kill your opponent.
What?! TRY?!?!
Okay... so, you may take a bit of time to prepare yourself.
As soon as you feel ready... you can fight.
Incredible, Senso is surrending!
I'm not surrending...
Are you ready?
Yes. Let's begin.
Not yet.


This is my lucky day...
Not yet.
Oh, okay. But remember our audience is waiting!
Good luck, mate. You're the best of us. I knew you'd make it to the final.
You've done great so far. It doesn't matter how this ends. Just... don't get yourself killed. Please.
Please do your best... I know you can! Also... we already defeated him once!
NO!!!
Please, no... he does not... deserve this...
He'll... be fine... Someone should assist him, and quickly.
Great news! And, don't worry, emergency services are already operative and will be here in a moment!
Prepare to lose, kiddo.
What's up? Afraid to attack?
I might actually need to take you seriously.
This time... you won't win.
The kiddo isn't playing anymore, I suppose.
You didn't gave me a single scratch.
If you can't defeat me, do you really think you'd have a chance with Desert? How pathetic.
In meanwhile...
Please, don't cry when you'll lose.
Senso has successfully defeated Heishi in an intense battle after completing all three of our challenges...
This means he's...
HE'S THE WINNER OF THE THREE CHALLENGEES!!!!!
Sooo... congratulations on the win! As a prize, you receive the wonderful Touriel sword, along with a generous prize of 10 000 credits!
If you want to participate again, you're more than welcome!
Y-you never know in life, ahaha. Aaaaand sooo we're done for this edition!
Thank you to everyone who attended this wonderful event! We hope to see you all at the next edition! And remember, be brave... because the next winner could be YOU! Thank yooouuuu, everyone! 
Byee!! You're lovely people!
I don't think so.
Great job! You know, I was so afraid... that you'd lose your life... and also...
Also we though you was about to kill Heishi. It would be... not very like you...
I wouldn't have killed him. Even if... I really hated him at some point...
Speaking of the devil...
Do you need something...?
Subscribe to the Three Challenges
Wait
Yeah, yeah... keep telling yourself that.
I changed my mind.
You should have finished him...
...Yuki...
The Ternion still needs plenty of time to be repaired. I suppose we can go look for a hotel and relax. We can also plan how to attack the DTA base while we're there.
Spend some time at a hotel
Hello, welcome. How many?
None.
Welcome! Here you'll find the latest fashion!
They're bloody expensive here, aren't they?!
Yuki!! She heard you!
Wanna have a drink?
Not thirsty.
Welcome, sir. Are you here for the test drive?
No.
Only the finest wares!
Thank you! I wish you a good continuation!
Welcome. Have a look at our aeroboards.
YOU! You're the one who won the challenges in the arena! If you want to buy something from my shop, you will get a 50% discount!
Can I take a photo with you?
No.
Okay... maybe next time...
Welcome back sir! I'm so glad to have you here!
Only the best weapons.
Welcome. Please, take a look at our catalogue.
Welcome. Do you need a room?
No, thanks.
