I knew eating that thing wasn't a good idea...
You tell him too that he can't abandon his family...
I had enough of this city and this planet.
Leave me alone, please...
I'd love to live in this place. There's so much going on, I reckon you could have a bit of fun around here.
This is exactly the kind of place you see in DTA documentaries. Not that I've seen many...
I can't wait to find a hotel. I'm sooo tired, and kind of hungry too.
Me too, honestly, but we must not waste too much time.
Those challenges look tough. Do we really need that sword?
If it will help us against Desert, I think we should. We have enough time.
I see you're a bit tired and nervous... I think you need a bit of rest...
I'm fine.
I can't stand this place... Too many ads, like everything wants people's attention... That must not feel good.
Are you okay?
Yes. Why shouldn't I?
Remember to go sign up for the challenges... otherwise, it might be too late...
I dunno...
This place looks strangely familiar!
What do we need to purchase for our journey?
We'll see what these shops have to offer.
Okay!
This city is so full of light! Quite understandable, since they can't have sunlight!
Indeed. There's too much light pollution...
I wonder why everyone look so depressed in this city.
Try living in a city that never sees the sunlight...
It sounds very depressing!
You can almost never see any stars in this city... Of course, the nebula is hidden too...
Unlike the city on Delta, I'm glad this city has some living beings in it.
I thought people would jump at you since you just won the "glorious" Three Challenges...
I reckon it was so "glorious" only for the presenter...
Are you sure we'll make it in time to sign up for the challenges?
I suppose we still have time, but once we get everything we need, I think we should go check...
I think this city has seen better days.
Yeah, but, dude, this is still better than everything we've ever seen!
Have you noticed that almost everyone wears the same clothes?
I'm afraid this society forces you to follow the latest trends so you don't get left out...
Pft, people here must have no personality.
If this city weren't on a tidally locked planet, I'd love to live here!
There are not many trees around here.
Yeah... This planet really looks terraformed...
There are so many shops here... I'd... visit them all...
I'd quite like to have a look in the clothes shops... if you don't mind, that is...
Did we just made 2000 credits just selling a single plant?!
Different world, different market.
We should start a business...
These aeroboards are AMAZING!
Indeed, they are! They're exactly what we needed!!
I hope we'll find a super-luxurious hotel at a humble price!
It will be just a waste of time and credits.
Shhh. Don't mind him. We do need some rest.
There aren't that many vehicles here. People apparently walk a lot.
What if we ate at that restaurant?
We have plenty of food since we went to Raithu. We should be fine with what we have.
Yeah, but, you know, I wouldn't mind tasting something new...
